  "answer_text": "It looks like there are several different entities that go by the name **\"Chase Capital Services\"** or similar names. Here's an overview of the most notable ones:\n\n---\n\n### 1. \ud83c\udfe6 JPMorgan Chase \u2013 Capital & Commercial Banking Services\nChase offers a broad range of financial services including credit cards, mortgages, commercial banking, auto loans, investing, and retirement planning.\n\nOn the commercial side, J.P. Morgan Chase provides tailored credit, financing, treasury, and payment solutions for businesses of all sizes and commercial real estate, with dedicated experts who deliver industry-specific guidance and services.\n\nThey also provide investment banking solutions, including M&A, capital raising, and risk management for a broad range of corporations, institutions, and governments.\n\n---\n\n### 2. \ud83c\udfe0 Chase Capital Holdings, LLC (Atlanta, GA)\nChase Capital Holdings, LLC is a trusted partner in investment real estate financing. It is a family-owned and operated boutique lending business based in Atlanta, with 20+ years of expertise in the industry, catering to experienced real estate investors throughout the Southeastern United States.\n\nThey understand the unique challenges and opportunities of the real estate market and are dedicated to providing a seamless and efficient experience, with a team of professionals to assist every step of the way.\n\n---\n\n### 3. \ud83c\udf3f Chase Capital (Canada)\nChase Capital is a private capital platform dedicated to investing in, advising, and helping unique businesses grow into dynamic platforms across Canada and other regions globally, bringing valuable capital and trusted industry expertise to acquisitions and partnerships.\n\nThey drive success in key growth sectors such as energy transition, waste & resource recovery infrastructure, and food & agricultural production, with a focus on sustainable and innovative projects.\n\nUnlike traditional private equity funds, Chase Capital invests its own capital and collaborates with a network of experienced entrepreneurs and investors, not bound by fixed exit timelines, focusing on building long-term, sustainable value.\n\n---\n\n### 4. \ud83d\udcc8 Chase Capital Partners (Closed)\nThis firm's broad platform positioned them to deliver extensive product capabilities \u2013 including lending, treasury services, investment banking, and asset management \u2013 to meet clients' U.S. and international financial needs. However, Chase Capital Partners is permanently closed.\n\n---\n\nCould you clarify which **Chase Capital Services** you're referring to? For example:\n- Are you asking about **JPMorgan Chase's** capital services?\n- The **Atlanta-based real estate lending firm**?\n- The **Canadian private equity platform**?\n\nThis will help me give you more specific and accurate information!",
